-599"><label>**</label><p>Drug concentrations in samples taken at time 0 were designated as 100%.</p></fn><fn id="tfn10-copd-2-599"><label>***</label><p>Nominal in the injected solution, corresponding to 444 &#x003bc;g/mL in the test suspension.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t3a-copd-2-599" position="float"><label>Table 3a</label><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="3" colspan="1"/><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="3" colspan="1"/><th valign="top" align="left" colspan="4" rowspan="1"><bold>Ipratropium bromide concentration</bold><hr/></th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" colspan="2" rowspan="1"><bold>% of initial concentration  &#x000b1; rel. SD (%)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn12-copd-2-599">**</xref></bold><hr/></th><th valign="top" align="left" colspan="4" rowspan="1"><bold>&#x003bc;g/ml (mean) &#x000b1; rel. SD (%)<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn11-copd-2-599">*</xref></bold><hr/></th></tr><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>after 5 h</bold></th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>after 25 h</bold></th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>nominal<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn13-copd-2-599">***</xref></bold></th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>initially</bold></th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>after 5 h</bold></th><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>after 25 h</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><italic>Control samples</italic></td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Atrovent<sup>&#x000ae;</sup> LS + Sultanol<sup>&#x000ae;</sup> in glass containers</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100.06  &#x000b1;  0.29</td><td 